ckdowns just  like the first round restaurants pubs  gyms and non-essential retailers all had  to shut down for at least 4 weeks  johnson went on to apologize that  christmas may be very different that  year and that he hopes that taking early  action can prevent even more action from  being required despite this somber  speech just two weeks later on november  13th 2020 staff members would reportedly  attend a gathering with carrie johnson  at the prime minister's residence  similarly just two weeks after this on  november 27 2020 a party would be thrown  for johnson senior aide cleo watson and  johnson would even give a speech at this  event a few weeks later on december 14th  2020 johnson's conservative party would  host a full-on party after hq in  westminster  by now i think you get the gist of  what's going on while the nation was  under strict lockdown johnson and his  colleagues basically just continued on  with the daily life on december 17 2020  a leaving party was thrown at the  cabinet office similarly on january 14  2021 another gathering was hosted to  celebrate the departure of two private  secretaries by this point it was clear  that johnson did not accidentally make a  violation here and there his colleagues  and he were consistently violating cobra  restrictions week after week but the  nail in the coffin didn't come until  april 16 to 2021 this time the downing  street staff hosted not one but two  parties fortunately johnson did not  attend either of these and covert  restrictions were much looser by this  point as vaccines were pretty readily  available but what made these parties  faithful was their ill timing you see  just one week before these parties queen  elizabeth ii husband and prince philip  duke of edenberg passed away on april 9  2021 the funeral was planned for april  17th 2020 which meant the downing street  parties took place the night before the  funeral for obvious reasons much of the  uk felt that these parties were  extremely d